{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Gem Wizard",
    "steam_appid": 2567950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Gem Wizard is an immersive dungeon-crawling game that combines the thrill of battle with the puzzle-solving excitement of Bejeweled. Players embark on a heroic quest to delve deep into a mysterious dungeon, where they must confront hordes of formidable enemies using their strategic gem-matching skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/33eb13e5a58e2c75324c3f1332efa04b.poster.avif?t=1699150334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/33eb13e5a58e2c75324c3f1332efa04b.webm?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/33eb13e5a58e2c75324c3f1332efa04b.mp4?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this game, you'll step into the shoes of a powerful wizard who must rely on their magical abilities, fueled by the gems they collect during intense Bejeweled-style battles. The core gameplay revolves around matching and combining gems on a grid to cast spells, defeat foes, and gather vital resources. Each gem type corresponds to a different element or spell, allowing players to strategically choose their moves and adapt to various enemy types.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/fe8f4eca650f77ba5dd52492676edf27.poster.avif?t=1699150334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/fe8f4eca650f77ba5dd52492676edf27.webm?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/fe8f4eca650f77ba5dd52492676edf27.mp4?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you progress through the dungeon's treacherous levels, you'll uncover relics that enhance your wizard's powers and grant unique abilities. These relics become essential tools for survival as the enemies grow stronger and more formidable the deeper you venture. The ultimate goal is to reach the dungeon's ominous final boss and utilize your acquired relics and magical prowess to overcome this formidable adversary and save the realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/507a25ec9e0c98e6621a43ba7f6c6c75.poster.avif?t=1699150334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/507a25ec9e0c98e6621a43ba7f6c6c75.webm?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/507a25ec9e0c98e6621a43ba7f6c6c75.mp4?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Gem Wizard, the fusion of puzzle-solving and RPG elements creates an engaging and challenging gameplay experience, where strategic thinking and adaptability are key to success. Delve into the depths of the dungeon, master the art of gem-matching, and become the ultimate Gem Wizard to defeat the final boss and save the world from impending doom.",
    "about_the_game": "Gem Wizard is an immersive dungeon-crawling game that combines the thrill of battle with the puzzle-solving excitement of Bejeweled. Players embark on a heroic quest to delve deep into a mysterious dungeon, where they must confront hordes of formidable enemies using their strategic gem-matching skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/33eb13e5a58e2c75324c3f1332efa04b.poster.avif?t=1699150334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/33eb13e5a58e2c75324c3f1332efa04b.webm?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/33eb13e5a58e2c75324c3f1332efa04b.mp4?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this game, you'll step into the shoes of a powerful wizard who must rely on their magical abilities, fueled by the gems they collect during intense Bejeweled-style battles. The core gameplay revolves around matching and combining gems on a grid to cast spells, defeat foes, and gather vital resources. Each gem type corresponds to a different element or spell, allowing players to strategically choose their moves and adapt to various enemy types.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/fe8f4eca650f77ba5dd52492676edf27.poster.avif?t=1699150334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/fe8f4eca650f77ba5dd52492676edf27.webm?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/fe8f4eca650f77ba5dd52492676edf27.mp4?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you progress through the dungeon's treacherous levels, you'll uncover relics that enhance your wizard's powers and grant unique abilities. These relics become essential tools for survival as the enemies grow stronger and more formidable the deeper you venture. The ultimate goal is to reach the dungeon's ominous final boss and utilize your acquired relics and magical prowess to overcome this formidable adversary and save the realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/507a25ec9e0c98e6621a43ba7f6c6c75.poster.avif?t=1699150334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/507a25ec9e0c98e6621a43ba7f6c6c75.webm?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567950/extras/507a25ec9e0c98e6621a43ba7f6c6c75.mp4?t=1699150334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Gem Wizard, the fusion of puzzle-solving and RPG elements creates an engaging and challenging gameplay experience, where strategic thinking and adaptability are key to success. Delve into the depths of the dungeon, master the art of gem-matching, and become the ultimate Gem Wizard to defeat the final boss and save the world from impending doom.",
    "short_description": "Gem Wizard: Match gems, cast spells, and collect relics as you venture through a perilous dungeon. Battle fierce foes, build your wizard's power, and face the ultimate boss to save the realm. A fusion of puzzle-solving and RPG action!",
